{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-20T19:32:31Z","input_tokens":154,"cache_read_tokens":44096,"output_tokens":1641,"thinking":"We need to run pipeline. The path python.exe in WindowsApps is a stub that expects to be interactive. Might need to use \"python.exe -X\" or run with \"python.exe -m ...\". The stub error says \"Python was not found; run without arguments to install from the Microsoft Store\". That means actual python isn't installed, just a placeholder. We cannot install software. So cannot run pipeline. According to guidelines, we must not attempt to bypass. We should report limitation and suggest user to install actual Python interpreter (e.g., from python.org). Then we can proceed with remaining deliverables once environment is ready.\n\nWe can still create remaining deliverable artifacts (SQL analytics, Power Query scripts, DAX measures, Excel workbook stub, executive report) without executing pipeline. That's acceptable: we can produce them as files.\n\nWe must inform user of limitation and ask them to install full Python. Then we can continue.\n\nWe need to create artifacts for SQL analytics, Power Query M scripts, DAX measures, Excel workbook (maybe a template), executive report, walkthrough script, CV bullet points, LinkedIn blurb, etc.\n\nWe should produce these artifacts now.\n\nCreate files: sql/analytics.sql, docs/power_query_scripts.md, docs/dax_measures.md, docs/executive_report.md, docs/linkedin_project.md, docs/cv_bullets.md, docs/walkthrough.md, docs/dashboard_walkthrough_script.txt, maybe Power BI spec diagrams.\n\nBut ensure we don't fabricate screenshots.\n\nWe'll create placeholder assets with instructions.\n\nProceed to create these files.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"SQL analytics script with KPI queries\",\"UserFacing\":false}","Content":"\"-- sql/analytics.sql\\n-- Analytical queries for FactoryPulse 360\\n\\n-- 1. OEE per line/shift/day\\nSELECT\\n    d.Date,\\n    l.LineName,\\n    s.ShiftName,\\n    SUM(fp.GoodUnits) AS GoodUnits,\\n    SUM(fp.TargetUnits) AS TargetUnits,\\n    SUM(fd.DowntimeMinutes) AS TotalDowntime,\\n    SUM(fe.EnergyKWh) AS TotalEnergy,\\n    -- Availability = (Planned - Downtime) / Planned\\n    ( ( (24*60) - SUM(fd.DowntimeMinutes) ) / (24*60) ) * 100 AS AvailabilityPct,\\n    -- Performance = ActualUnits / (PlannedUnits * IdealCycleTime)\\n    ( SUM(fp.GoodUnits) / (SUM(fp.TargetUnits) * 0.5) ) * 100 AS PerformancePct,\\n    -- Quality = GoodUnits / ProducedUnits\\n    ( SUM(fp.GoodUnits) / NULLIF(SUM(fp.ProducedUnits),0) ) * 100 AS QualityPct,\\n    ( ( ( (24*60) - SUM(fd.DowntimeMinutes) ) / (24*60) ) *\\n      ( SUM(fp.GoodUnits) / (SUM(fp.TargetUnits) * 0.5) ) *\\n      ( SUM(fp.GoodUnits) / NULLIF(SUM(fp.ProducedUnits),0) ) ) * 100 AS OEE_Pct\\nFROM FactProduction fp\\nJOIN FactDowntime fd ON fp.DateKey = fd.DateKey AND fp.ShiftKey = fd.ShiftKey AND fp.MachineKey = fd.MachineKey\\nJOIN FactEnergy fe ON fp.DateKey = fe.DateKey AND fp.ShiftKey = fe.ShiftKey AND fp.MachineKey = fe.MachineKey\\nJOIN DimDate d ON fp.DateKey = d.DateKey\\nJOIN DimShift s ON fp.ShiftKey = s.ShiftKey\\nJOIN DimLine l ON fp.MachineKey = (SELECT MachineKey FROM DimMachine WHERE MachineKey = fp.MachineKey)\\nGROUP BY d.Date, l.LineName, s.ShiftName\\nORDER BY d.Date;\\n\\n-- 2. Downtime Pareto by reason (cumulative percentage)\\nWITH downtime_by_reason AS (\\n    SELECT r.ReasonCode, SUM(fd.DowntimeMinutes) AS TotalMinutes\\n    FROM FactDowntime fd\\n    JOIN DimReason r ON fd.ReasonKey = r.ReasonKey\\n    GROUP BY r.ReasonCode\\n), ranked AS (\\n    SELECT ReasonCode, TotalMinutes,\\n           SUM(TotalMinutes) OVER (ORDER BY TotalMinutes DESC) AS CumulativeMinutes,\\n           SUM(TotalMinutes) OVER () AS GrandTotal,\\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY TotalMinutes DESC) AS rn\\n    FROM downtime_by_reason\\n)\\nSELECT ReasonCode, TotalMinutes,\\n       (CumulativeMinutes * 1\n<truncated 1966 bytes>","Path":"\"C:/Users/Hp/.gemini/antigravity/brain/00691f59-1a7d-42ed-8916-27f2977073aa/sql/analytics.sql\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
